   need:'Essential: at least 2 hours a week, friendly and approachable, reliable and trustworthy. Helpful but not essential: confident in English and/or other languages, kitchen experience, experience with adults, children or families in a support setting.',
   grow:'Customer service, food prep, working with families and children.',net:'The Support Coordinator, Cafe Assistant, volunteers and the Raise Up team.',
